  "description": "Tae-in, the daughter of medicine expert of the village, is said to be found by everyone when there is a problem. On the way home, a funny situation happened with a man, and Tae-in's father, who was drunk, picked the man up! The man's name was Ki-hyeon. I thought he was a foolish person. It is not normal to have the ability to quickly solve problems whenever there is an emergency. When I came to my senses, Ki-hyeon entered Tae-in's heart before I knew it... (by Google Translate)\n\nOriginal Novel\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=792654), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8305646)\n\n**Official Translation:**  \n[Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/secret-outing/list?title_no=4300)",
